 in English.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "A2", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-fad00d12db", "expression": "Technology-wise,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a sentence to focus attention on a specific aspect", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to narrow focus to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "Technology-wise This is a useful expression for expressing yourself naturally in English.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-be7a5cdeef", "expression": "When it comes to", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "Use at the start of a sentence to focus attention on a specific aspect", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Used to narrow focus to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "When it comes to cooking, I'm definitely more of a beginner than an expert.", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags": ["topic-introduction"], "seeAlso": []}, {"id": "dm-bfa5587a0a", "expression": "When it comes to ...,", "variants": [], "collocation": {"en": "When it comes to [topic], [general statement + elaboration]...", "zh": ""}, "contexts": {"en": "Template pattern: fill the placeholder with topic-relevant content. Used to Used to narrow focus to a specific aspect of the question", "zh": ""}, "connotation": {"en": "semi-formal, appropriate for IELTS context, signals topic management skills", "zh": ""}, "example": {"en": "When it comes to", "zh": ""}, "cefr": "B1", "categoryIds": ["cat-016"], "subfunctionIds": [], "chainIds": [], "tags"